{"id":"47c82d5007a17e60","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-sequentialtransversal.md","title":"Sequential generation of minimal transversals","display":"df-sequentialtransversal — Sequential generation of minimal transversals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-sequentialtransversal","aliases":["27-df-sequentialtransversal"],"display":"df-sequentialtransversal — Sequential generation of minimal transversals","depends_on":["[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§4.3.2 SD-Dualization; Theorem 4.30","source_printed_pages":"187,188,189","source_pdf_pages":"211,212,213","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-sequentialtransversal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-sequentialtransversal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sequentialtransversal — Sequential generation of minimal transversals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.3.2 SD-Dualization; Theorem 4.30"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"187,188,189"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"211,212,213"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a>），<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_1,\\ldots,E_m\\subseteq N\">\\(E_1,\\ldots,E_m\\subseteq N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\">\\(\\mathcal A,\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\)</span>；空交族条件按通常全称量词解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}(\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal A\\mid\\nexists T\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T\\subsetneq S)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}(\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal A\\mid\\nexists T\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T\\subsetneq S)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{S\\subseteq N\\mid\\forall E\\in\\mathcal H\\;S\\cap E\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{S\\subseteq N\\mid\\forall E\\in\\mathcal H\\;S\\cap E\\ne\\varnothing\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_0\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{T\\cup\\{i\\}\\mid T\\in\\mathcal T_{k-1},\\ i\\in E_k\\}\\quad(1\\le k\\le m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_0\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{T\\cup\\{i\\}\\mid T\\in\\mathcal T_{k-1},\\ i\\in E_k\\}\\quad(1\\le k\\le m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\mathcal T_k=\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\{E_1,\\ldots,E_k\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\mathcal T_k=\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\{E_1,\\ldots,E_k\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>正 DNF 中逐项加入对偶子句对应给超图逐边增加击中约束。一个新极小横截集包含某个旧极小横截集，并且与新边相交，所以由 T∪{i} 生成后删除非极小集合即可。递归沿有限 k 良基，故定义唯一；E_k 为空时无横截集，m=0 时唯一横截集为空集。此算法的中间族可能很大，不能据其简洁形式推断输出多项式总时间。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N$ 为有限集，$m\\in\\mathbb N$（见 [[27-df-nat]]），$E_1,\\ldots,E_m\\subseteq N$。$\\mathcal A,\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)$；空交族条件按通常全称量词解释。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"E_1,\\ldots,E_m\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A,\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}(\\mathcal A)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathcal A\\mid\\nexists T\\in\\mathcal A\\;(T\\subsetneq S)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{S\\subseteq N\\mid\\forall E\\in\\mathcal H\\;S\\cap E\\ne\\varnothing\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_0\\coloneqq\\{\\varnothing\\},\\qquad\\mathcal T_k\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{T\\cup\\{i\\}\\mid T\\in\\mathcal T_{k-1},\\ i\\in E_k\\}\\quad(1\\le k\\le m).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\;\\mathcal T_k=\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\{E_1,\\ldots,E_k\\}).","display":true}],"bytes":2083,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-sequentialtransversal|df-sequentialtransversal — Sequential generation of minimal transversals]]"},{"id":"98840b4d8c8dfdc2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N$ 为有限集，$\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)$ 是 clutter，即不同成员互不包含；$S\\subseteq N$。$\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq},\\mathrm{blk}$ 见 [[27-df-sequentialtransversal]]。"},{"id":"9239c460a3df52aa","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N$ 为非空有限集，$\\mathcal P,\\mathcal T$ 为 $\\mathcal P(N)\\setminus\\{\\varnothing\\}$ 的非空 clutter 子族。$\\mathrm{blk}_N$ 见 [[27-df-sequentialtransversal]]。$c\\in\\mathbb R^N$ 是任意实权向量。"}],"outgoing":["d87d01e5686c19fe"]}